    <li><strong>Field-level access</strong>: read levels, protected reads, and the deployment preflight. See <a href="/docs/specs/field-access">field-access.md</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Routing and typed controllers</strong>: the invocation contract this tutorial leaned on. See <a href="/docs/specs/app-controller-invocation">app-controller-invocation.md</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Read the corpus</strong>: browse the <a href="/docs">versioned docs</a> or use the site's read-only <a href="/.well-known/mcp.json">MCP endpoint</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</main>
